&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Founded by global technology pioneer Larry Ellison and esteemed physician and author Dr. David Agus, Sensei Ag is a market-changing AgTech company on a journey to improve human nutrition. Our greenhouse farms align technology with the environment to protect and preserve natural resources while optimizing how we grow food. Merging agriculture and innovation to achieve sustainable farming practices allows us to grow high-quality, delicious produce year-round. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a hands-on, detail-oriented&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Controller&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong Cost Accounting background to strengthen the company’s financial rigor, processes, controls, reporting, and analysis to support business decision-making and operational excellence.&amp;nbsp;This position reports to the SVP, Accounting &amp;amp; Finance and is fully remote. Prior experience in Agriculture, Biotech, Manufacturing, or another production/inventory-intensive environment is a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted financial advisor to the SVP, Accounting &amp;amp; Finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the month-end and year-end close and prepare and review monthly financial statements, management reporting, and financial analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ensure accounting practices and financial reporting comply with U.S. GAAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee general ledger, accounts payable, accounts receivable, fixed assets, inventory, accruals, and reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain appropriate accounting policies, procedures, and documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support annual audits, tax filings, and other external financial reporting requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead and improve cost accounting processes, including product costing, inventory valuation, labor and overhead allocation, and COGS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analyze production costs, margins, variances, and operational performance and provide actionable insights to management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with operations to improve cost visibility, financial accountability, and operational performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop, document, and implement strong internal controls and approval processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Serve as the key finance owner of NetSuite, including evaluating configuration, reporting, workflows, controls, and overall utilization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Evaluate and improve financial systems, processes, and workflows, including opportunities for automation and integration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with IT and other departments to ensure financial systems effectively support operational and reporting needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead, develop, and support the accounting team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support budgeting, forecasting, cash flow management, and financial planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Skills and Requirements&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or Finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong technical accounting foundation and knowledge of GAAP. CPA required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;10+ years of progressive accounting/finance experience, including Controller or senior accounting leadership experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong NetSuite experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong cost accounting experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and strengthening internal controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to streamline processes and improve financial systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on, proactive approach with the ability to work at both the detailed accounting level and strategically across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sensei Ag is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are committed to fair and equitable compensation for all employees. We thoughtfully consider a wide range of factors when determining individual compensation. The expected annual pay range for this role is between $170,000 - $195,000.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Founded by global technology pioneer Larry Ellison and esteemed physician and author Dr. David Agus, Sensei Ag is a market-changing AgTech company on a journey to improve human nutrition. Our greenhouse farms align technology with the environment to protect and preserve natural resources while optimizing how we grow food. Merging agriculture and innovation to achieve sustainable farming practices allows us to grow high-quality, delicious produce year-round. The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Technician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;position is your opportunity to join a team of talented, creative, roll up your sleeves and get it done collaborators with an exceptional ability to think beyond what is.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Technician&lt;/strong&gt; is the hands on go to person for all things in support of our facility R&amp;amp;D Greenhouse in Somis, CA.&amp;nbsp; The selected candidate will take on projects big and small, technical and non-technical in support of the daily operational needs. This is a unique opportunity to join a dynamic facility where multiple cross-functional teams are working together to test various new hardware and robotic technologies, growing systems and crops. This role will be accountable for the safety, maintenance and organization of the facility to enable these activities. This is a 5 day per week on location position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solve and troubleshoot with engineering teams for repairs, construction, commissioning and system upgrades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on maintenance and repair including: plumbing, electrical, lighting, painting etc. for buildings, vehicles and machine/greenhouse grow systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain a preventive maintenance and work-order program, including asset records, inspection schedules, critical spare-parts inventory, repair prioritization, and closure tracking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outdoor upkeep including but not limited to: sprinkler repair, external building maintenance, AC systems monitoring and maintenance, outdoor storage maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and coordinate equipment vendors, contractors, service providers as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain facility cleanliness, sanitation, biosecurity, environmental integrity, and readiness for trials, tours, audits, and operational activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support purchasing and keeping supplies ready in advance of activities on site including office supplies and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support shipping and receiving, inventory control, material handling, visitor and contractor coordination, and other site activities as operational needs require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Corp Safety leader in support of facility safety activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Abilities and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some post HS trade school or equivalent required, BA/BS a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years’ experience in a facilities maintenance role with demonstrated ability to work with limited direction and oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a manufacturing or machine shop environment, agriculture related field a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with preventive maintenance, work-order systems, equipment troubleshooting, vendors, contractors, and facility projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with basic plumbing and electrical repairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in greenhouse operations, including control system operations, a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful and creative problem solver with extensive handyman skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with an eye for detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and&amp;nbsp; interpersonal skills, the ability to navigate in a matrix organization and coordinate across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with basic computer systems including email, and MS Suite, and the proven ability to learn new systems and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work nights and weekends on call as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in greenhouse, production, warehouse, laboratory, office, and outdoor areas with variable temperature, humidity, noise, light, and exposure to water, soil, plant material, and approved agricultural inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver’s license &amp;amp; Forklift Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sensei Ag is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are committed to fair and equitable compensation for all employees. We thoughtfully consider a wide range of factors when determining individual compensation. The expected pay range for this role is between $50 and $65 per hour.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Founded by global technology pioneer Larry Ellison and esteemed physician and author Dr. David Agus, Sensei Ag is a market-changing AgTech company on a journey to improve human nutrition. Our greenhouse farms align technology with the environment to protect and preserve natural resources while optimizing how we grow food. Merging agriculture and innovation to achieve sustainable farming practices allows us to grow high-quality, delicious produce year-round. The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Facility Support Technician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;position is your opportunity to join a team of talented, creative, roll up your sleeves and get it done collaborators with an exceptional ability to think beyond what is.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Facility Support Technician&lt;/strong&gt; supports our R&amp;amp;D Greenhouse in Somis, CA.&amp;nbsp; The selected candidate will take on projects big and small, technical and non-technical in support of the daily operational needs. This is a unique opportunity to join a dynamic facility where multiple cross-functional teams are working together to test various new hardware and robotic technologies, growing systems and crops. This role will be accountable for the safety, maintenance and organization of the facility to enable these activities. This is a 5 day per week on location position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on maintenance and repair including: plumbing, electrical, lighting, painting etc. for buildings, vehicles and machine/greenhouse grow systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outdoor upkeep including but not limited to: sprinkler repair, external building maintenance, AC systems monitoring and maintenance, outdoor storage maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;POC for outside vendors including trades, contractors, and service providers as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists engineering teams with for repairs, construction, commissioning, upgrades, and technical troubleshooting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain facility cleanliness, sanitation, biosecurity, environmental integrity, and readiness for trials, tours, audits, and operational activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducts preventative maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support purchasing and keeping supplies ready in advance of activities on site including office supplies and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support shipping and receiving, inventory control, material handling, visitor and contractor coordination, and other site activities as operational needs require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with growing teams on planting and harvesting on an as needed basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follows safety procedures and reports safety implements corrective actions as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Abilities and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some post HS trade school or equivalent required, BA/BS a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years’ experience in a facilities maintenance role with demonstrated ability to work with limited direction and oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a manufacturing or machine shop environment, agriculture related field a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with preventive maintenance, work-order systems, equipment troubleshooting, vendors, contractors, and facility projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with basic plumbing and electrical repairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in greenhouse operations, including control system operations, a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful and creative problem solver with extensive handyman skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with an eye for detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and&amp;nbsp; interpersonal skills, the ability to navigate in a matrix organization and coordinate across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with basic computer systems including email, and MS Suite, and the proven ability to learn new systems and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work nights and weekends on call as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in greenhouse, production, warehouse, laboratory, office, and outdoor areas with variable temperature, humidity, noise, light, and exposure to water, soil, plant material, and approved agricultural inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver’s license &amp;amp; Forklift Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sensei Ag is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are committed to fair and equitable compensation for all employees. We thoughtfully consider a wide range of factors when determining individual compensation. The expected pay range for this role is between $40 and $55 per hour.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE &amp;amp; WHAT WE DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Founded by global technology pioneer, Larry Ellison and esteemed physician and author, Dr. David Agus, Sensei Ag is a market-changing AgTech company on a journey to improve human nutrition. Our greenhouse farms align technology with the environment to protect and preserve natural resources, while optimizing how we grow food. Merging agriculture and innovation to achieve sustainable farming practices allows us to grow high-quality, delicious produce year-round.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHERE IS THIS JOB LOCATED?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;This is &lt;strong&gt;TEMPORARY&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ON-SITE &lt;/strong&gt;position located in Lanai City, Lanai, Hawaii&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;$18.36 / hour, Non-Exempt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Sensei Ag is hiring Farm Associates to be in charge of everything needed to keep crops healthy, productive, and in great shape. They&#39;re also responsible for packing fruits, vegetables, and doing other jobs that help the farm run smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your main goal is to ensure the health and condition of crops are maintained. This involves tasks like planting and transplanting seedlings, helping vine crops grow, and removing shoots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll also help with harvesting, weighing, and packing produce, making sure it&#39;s graded and packaged correctly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It&#39;s important to keep an eye out for any signs of insect or disease damage, as well as food safety issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your workspace should always be clean and organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate farm equipment safely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular communication with your Team Lead to report any quality issues or damage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all actions comply with SOPs, occupational safety, Good Manufacturing Practices (GMPs), food safety, and company policies and procedures to meet expectations consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional duties as needed or required by management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;WHAT SKILLS DO I NEED TO APPLY?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a light industrial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently or as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be comfortable with heights and using ladders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in greenhouses with &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW177528170 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177528170 BCX8&quot;&gt;varying environmental conditions, such as heat, UV exposure or a cold packing room.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to safely lift up to 50 lbs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able stand for long periods, including walking, bending, kneeling, and climbing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comply with follow food safety practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have reliable transportation to get to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Farming or greenhouse experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDUCATIONAL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School diploma or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY YOU SHOULD JOIN US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW174440589 BCX8&quot;&gt;Sensei Ag is expanding and seeking highly skilled individuals to be part of our team. Experience a dynamic and collaborative work culture&amp;nbsp; as we revolutionize health and the future of food. We are looking for individuals who are intelligent, yet humble, dedicated and genuine, with grit and lots of it! Become a part of our team today!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This job description is not intended to be an exhaustive list of all duties, responsibilities or qualifications associated with the job. Other duties may be assigned.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
